 ### Data Structures
 **Internal Node Layout:**
-*   **Children:** $N^3$ child pointers. Each pointer is an 8-bit offset relative to a 32-bit base address stored within the node. If a child is null, it is marked as such. The maximum branching factor $N$ is 6 because $6^3 = 216$ fits within 8 bits (max value 255) [S1].
-*   **Color Attributes:** Minimum color, average color, and maximum color. These are used for wavelet compression [S1].
