 ## Background
-The Compact Pointer Tree was introduced in the paper "Compression and Interactive Visualization of Terabyte Scale Volumetric RGBA Data with Voxel-scale Details" [S1]. It was developed to address the challenge of visualizing extremely large volumetric datasets interactively. The method builds on hierarchical DDA [Museth 2021] to accelerate content on GPU while streaming [S1].
